msgid "Ansible Tower Jobs are commonly used for:"
msgstr "Ansible Tower Jobs son commonly used para:"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/ansible_tower_job.rst:13
msgid "Configuration management during Instance provisioning"
msgstr "Configuration management during Instancia aprovisionamiento"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/ansible_tower_job.rst:14
msgid "Application deployment workflows"
