msgstr "Inventories y Groups establecer up en Ansible Tower"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/ansible_tower_job.rst:24
msgid "Network connectivity between |morpheus| and the Ansible Tower server"
msgstr "Network connectivity entre |morpheus| y el/la Ansible Tower servidor"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/ansible_tower_job.rst:27
msgid "Configuring an Ansible Tower Integration"
msgstr "Configuring an Ansible Tower Integraciones"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/ansible_tower_job.rst:29
msgid "Before creating Ansible Tower Job Tasks, add the integration:"
msgstr "Before creating Ansible Tower Job Tareas, add the integraciones:"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/ansible_tower_job.rst:31
msgid "Navigate to Administration > Integrations"
msgstr "Navegue a Administration > Integraciones"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/ansible_tower_job.rst:32
#: ../../provisioning/automation/ansible_tower_job.rst:48
msgid "Click :guilabel:`+ ADD`"
msgstr "Hacer clic :guilabel:`+ ADD`"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/ansible_tower_job.rst:33
msgid "Select **Ansible Tower** as the integration type"
msgstr "Select **Ansible Tower** as the integraciones type"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/ansible_tower_job.rst:34
msgid "Configure:"
msgstr "Configurar:"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/ansible_tower_job.rst:36
msgid "**NAME:** Descriptive name"
msgstr "**NAME:** Descriptive nombre"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/ansible_tower_job.rst:37
msgid "**URL:** Ansible Tower server URL (e.g., ``https://tower.example.com``)"
msgstr "**URL:** Ansible Tower servidor URL (e.g., ``https://tower.example.com``)"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/ansible_tower_job.rst:38
msgid "**USERNAME:** Tower API username"
msgstr "**USERNAME:** Tower API username"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/ansible_tower_job.rst:39
msgid "**PASSWORD:** Tower API password or token"
msgstr "**PASSWORD:** Tower API password o token"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/ansible_tower_job.rst:40
msgid "**API VERSION:** Tower API version"
msgstr "**API VERSION:** Tower API versión"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/ansible_tower_job.rst:42
msgid "Click :guilabel:`SAVE`"
msgstr "Hacer clic :guilabel:`SAVE`"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/ansible_tower_job.rst:45
msgid "Creating an Ansible Tower Job Task"
msgstr "Creating an Ansible Tower Job Tarea"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/ansible_tower_job.rst:47
msgid "Navigate to :menuselection:`Library --> Automation` > Tasks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../provisioning/automation/ansible_tower_job.rst:49
msgid "Select **Ansible Tower Job** as the Task Type"
msgstr "Select **Ansible Tower Job** as the Tarea Type"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/ansible_tower_job.rst:50
msgid "Configure the Task:"
msgstr "Configure the Tarea:"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/ansible_tower_job.rst:52
msgid "**NAME:** Descriptive name for the Task"
msgstr "**NAME:** Descriptive name for the Tarea"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/ansible_tower_job.rst:53
msgid "**CODE:** Unique code for API, CLI, and variable references"
msgstr "**CODE:** Unique code para API, CLI, y variable references"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/ansible_tower_job.rst:54
msgid "**TOWER INTEGRATION:** Select the Ansible Tower integration"
msgstr "**TOWER INTEGRATION:** Seleccione el Ansible Tower integraciones"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/ansible_tower_job.rst:55
msgid ""
"**INVENTORY:** Select an existing Tower Inventory. When bootstrapping an "
"Instance, |morpheus| adds the Instance to this Inventory."
msgstr ""
"**INVENTORY:** Seleccionar un existente Tower Inventory. Cuando "
"bootstrapping un Instancia, |morpheus| adds el/la Instancia a este "
"Inventory."

#: ../../provisioning/automation/ansible_tower_job.rst:56
msgid ""
"**GROUP:** Enter a Group name. When bootstrapping, |morpheus| adds the "
"Instance to this Group. If the Group does not exist in Tower, |morpheus| "
"creates it."
msgstr ""
"**GROUP:** Ingresar un Group nombre. Cuando bootstrapping, |morpheus| "
"adds el/la Instancia a este Group. Si el/la Group hace no exist en Tower,"
" |morpheus| creates it."

#: ../../provisioning/automation/ansible_tower_job.rst:57
msgid "**JOB TEMPLATE:** Select the Job Template to execute"
msgstr "**JOB TEMPLATE:** Seleccione el Job Template to execute"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/ansible_tower_job.rst:58
msgid ""
"**SCM OVERRIDE:** (Optional) Specify an SCM branch other than that "
"configured on the Template"
msgstr ""
"**SCM OVERRIDE:** (Optional) Especificar un SCM branch otro than que "
"configurado en el/la Plantilla"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/ansible_tower_job.rst:59
msgid "**EXECUTE MODE:** Select the execution scope:"
msgstr "**EXECUTE MODE:** Seleccione el ejecución scope:"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/ansible_tower_job.rst:61
msgid "**Limit to Instance:** Template executes only on the provisioned Instance"
msgstr ""
"**Limit to Instancia:** Template executes only on the provisioned "
"Instancia"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/ansible_tower_job.rst:62
msgid "**Limit to Group:** Template executes on all hosts in the Group"
msgstr "**Limit to Group:** Plantilla executes en todos hosts en el/la Group"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/ansible_tower_job.rst:63
msgid "**Run for All:** Template executes on all hosts in the Inventory"
msgstr "**Run for All:** Plantilla executes en todos hosts en el/la Inventory"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/ansible_tower_job.rst:64
msgid ""
"**Skip Execution:** Template execution is skipped (Instance is still "
"added to Inventory/Group)"
msgstr ""
"**Skip Execution:** Template ejecución is skipped (Instancia is still "
"added to Inventory/Group)"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/ansible_tower_job.rst:66
msgid "Click :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`"
msgstr "Hacer clic :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/ansible_tower_job.rst:69
msgid "Execute Modes Explained"
msgstr "Execute Modes Explained"

